gText_IntroSpeech_Welcome::
	.string "Hello.\p"
	.string "My name is Cynthia.\p"
	.string "I travel around Sinnoh, studying\n"
	.string "its myths and ruins.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_IntroSpeech_MainSpeech::
	.string "There are Pokémon all over this\n"
	.string "world. In the mountains, in the\l"
	.string "sea, and in towns, living right\l"
	.string "beside us.\p"
	.string "The old stories say there was once\n"
	.string "a Pokémon so large it could move\l"
	.string "the land itself.\p"
	.string "Nobody knows whether that's true.\n"
	.string "I'd like to find out.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_IntroSpeech_AndYouAre::
	.string "But that's enough about me.\n"
	.string "I'd like to hear about you.$"

gText_IntroSpeech_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Are you a boy,\n"
	.string "or a girl?$"

gText_IntroSpeech_WhatsYourName::
	.string "And what should I call you?$"

gText_IntroSpeech_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So it's {PLAYER}?$"

gText_IntroSpeech_YourePlayer::
	.string "{PLAYER}. Okay, I'll remember it.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_IntroSpeech_AreYouReady::
	.string "I can't wait to see where your\n"
	.string "journey takes you.\p"
	.string "Who knows? Maybe Sinnoh's next\n"
	.string "Champion is standing right in\l"
	.string "front of me.\p"
	.string "$"
